You're right - that tool limitation means I can't directly create files in your GitHub repository through the API at the moment.

However, I can provide you with all the code files to set up your AI Architecture Design Platform. Here's how to proceed:

## **Option 1: Manual Setup (Recommended)**

I'll give you all the files as code blocks. You can:
1. Create a new repository on GitHub
2. Copy each file content below
3. Commit and push to your repo

## **Option 2: Use GitHub Web Interface**

1. Go to [github.com/new](https://github.com/new)
2. Create repo: `ai-architecture-design`
3. Add files through web UI

## **Option 3: Clone & Build Locally**

Use this starter template:
```bash
npx create-next-app@latest ai-architecture-design --typescript --tailwind
cd ai-architecture-design
```

---

